{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7f6a8f3a50756ba2","name":"Sporting Blaster Carbine","source":{"id":"source:reference-7f6a8f3a50756ba2","title":"Sporting Blaster Carbine","revision":20316,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:37:24Z","sha256":"6a22dbae845a1e218a165447ae0735819ac2c67d8f4013bdd845dcded1e70d3f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20316","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sporting%20Blaster%20Carbine&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7f6a8f3a50756ba2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Sporting Blaster Carbine is designed to take the compact design of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Carbine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Carbine","referenceId":"reference:76b5919337653c76"}," and increase its accuracy, making it more competitive at long ranges. The bounty hunter ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jariah Syn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jariah_Syn","referenceId":"reference:ffe47c389f801ce7"}," uses a Sporting Blaster Carbine on occasion. A Sporting Blaster Carbine is not treated as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Inaccurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inaccurate"}," weapon when wielded in two hands. Sporting Blaster Carbines have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Retractable Stocks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Retractable_Stocks"},". Like all carbines, the Sporting Blaster Carbine can be used to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},", even without a folded stock.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Sporting Blaster Carbine requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 100 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2.6 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
